      "subsystem": "CALCulate",
      "unverified": true,
      "notes": "Path fixed 2026-11-11 (was `:CALCulate:LIMit:LOWer <limit>`): 4263B Operation Manual 04263-90041 (Agilent, ch. 5 GPIB Reference: Subsystem Command List p. 5-2/5-3 and Command Reference p. 5-8 on; the 4263A's own manual is not obtainable) p. 5-10: `:CALCulate{1|2}:LIMit:LOWer[:DATA]` — the comparator limit belongs to CALCulate1 (primary) or 2; the bare CALCulate meant suffix 1, now written out as the unit's own *LRN? (bench 2026-11-12 03:07 UTC, 3145J01840 fw 02.00) answers `:CALC1:LIM:STAT 0`. Never sent in this form, so still unverified"
    },
