      "notes": "Path fixed 2026-11-11 (was `:SENSe:VOLTage:RANGe:AUTO <state>`): 4263B Operation Manual 04263-90041 (Agilent, ch. 5 GPIB Reference: Subsystem Command List p. 5-2/5-3 and Command Reference p. 5-8 on; the 4263A's own manual is not obtainable) p. 5-26: no SENSe:VOLTage subsystem — auto range is `[:SENSe]:FIMPedance:RANGe:AUTO`; the unit's own *LRN? (bench 2026-11-12 03:07 UTC, 3145J01840 fw 02.00) answers `:FIMP:APER +6.5E-02;RANG:AUTO 1`. Never sent in this form, so still unverified"
    },
    "Current_Range": {
      "scpi": ":SENSe:FIMPedance:RANGe:UPPer <range>",
      "scpiFast": ":SENS:FIMP:RANG:UPP <range>",
      "description": "Sets the impedance measurement range in ohms (0.1 to 1M, or UP/DOWN); the name is kept for the panels that bind it.",
