      "args": [
        "range"
      ],
      "subsystem": "SENSe",
      "unverified": true,
      "notes": "Path fixed 2026-11-11 (was `:SENSe:CURRent:RANGe <range>`): 4263B Operation Manual 04263-90041 (Agilent, ch. 5 GPIB Reference: Subsystem Command List p. 5-2/5-3 and Command Reference p. 5-8 on; the 4263A's own manual is not obtainable) p. 5-27: the 4263B has no SENSe:CURRent subsystem — its one measurement range is the impedance range `[:SENSe]:FIMPedance:RANGe[:UPPer] <ohms>` (0.1, 1, 10, 100, 1k, 10k, 100k, 1M; MIN/MAX/UP/DOWN); the unit's own *LRN? (bench 2026-11-12 03:07 UTC, 3145J01840 fw 02.00) answers `:FIMP:APER …;RANG:AUTO 1`. Never sent in this form, so still unverified"
    },
