      "subsystem": "Common",
      "notes": "Bench 2026-11-12 03:07–03:08 UTC, HP 4263A 3145J01840 fw 02.00 on gpib7,11 (asked alone through /api/instrument/send, SYST:ERR? after: +0): `*IDN?` answered HEWLETT-PACKARD,4263A,3145J01840,02.00"
    },
    "Learn_Settings": {
      "scpi": "*LRN?",
      "description": "Reads the learn string: every current setting in one reply.",
      "returns": {
        "count": 1,
        "type": "AARD"
      },
      "subsystem": "Common",
      "notes": "Bench 2026-11-12 03:07–03:08 UTC, HP 4263A 3145J01840 fw 02.00 on gpib7,11 (asked alone through /api/instrument/send, SYST:ERR? after: +0): `*LRN?` answered 18 `;`-separated settings: :FUNC:CONC 0;:FUNC \"FADM\";:CAL:CABL +0;:SOUR:FREQ +1.00000E+03;VOLT +1.00000E+00;VOLT:OFFS:STAT 0;:AVER 1;:AVER:COUN +1;:FIMP:APER +6.50000E-02;RANG:AUTO 1;:FIMP:CONT:VER 0;:TRIG:DEL +0.00000E+00;SOUR INT;:CALC1:FORM CP;:CALC2:FORM D;:CALC1:MATH:STAT 0;:CALC2:MATH:STAT 0;:CALC1:LIM:STAT 0 — the whole-state nab; it answers many values, so it is never stacked into the GRAB"
    },
    "Get_Operation_Complete": {
