        "type": "NR1"
      },
      "subsystem": "Common",
      "notes": "Bench 2026-11-07 03:12 UTC, HP 4263A 3145J01840 fw 02.00 on gpib7,11: the instrument page's Certify passed, answered 1"
    },
    "Nab_All_C": {
      "scpi": "*TRG;*WAI;:FETCh?",
      "scpiFast": "*TRG;*WAI;:FETC?",
      "description": "One C reading on the rigged setup: triggers and reads status, cp, d.",
      "group": "All C",
      "subsystem": "MEASure",
      "unverified": true,
      "returns": {
        "count": 3,
        "separator": ",",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "status",
            "type": "NR1"
          },
          {
            "name": "cp",
            "type": "NR3"
          },
          {
            "name": "d",
            "type": "NR3"
          }
        ]
      },
      "notes": "Friends: Rig_All_C once at the beginning (impedance/admittance function, the parameter pair, bus trigger, frequency, level), then Nab_All_C as many times as wanted — each nab one bus trigger and its reading. Authored 2026-11-12 on the owner's ask — unverified on the bench. The unit's *LRN? confirms :FUNC \"FADM\" with CALC1 CP / CALC2 D; \"FIMP\" and the CP/D spellings are recalled from the 4263B guide (REAL/IMAG read R/X under FIMP and G/B under FADM; MLIN/PHAS read |Z| or |Y| and θ); run Rig_All_C first — the reading is whatever the meter is set to"
    },
